      "decision": "reject-replacement-as-security-regression",
      "rationale": "The Hub route replaces the sovereign first-admin bootstrap workflow with read-only diagnostics, removing the short-lived single-use email proof and explicit claim flow. Retain the RONSAS implementation.",
      "future_option": "Consider the Hub diagnostics helper only as a separate read-only admin diagnostic after independent review."
    },
